  :8074. Wrong: server_mode.ingest_long_context.alias_of = architect_general,
  server_mode.architect_general.shared_with includes it, src/roles.py maps it
  to ARCHITECT_GENERAL, src/config/models.py routes it to :8083 (ruling C2).
  candidate_roles membership is unchanged.

